      "reasoning": "\"There they are again, those two Solitudes, like specters haunting my options! They just *won't* go away, constantly reminding me of the spells I can't cast, trying to plant seeds of doubt. It's a psychological gambit, I tell you, a test of my mental fortitude!\n\
