      "player": "Gem25F Truth",
      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "\"Aha! They're still stuck in 'combat_phase: blockers' with `action_pending: True`! This confirms it – my previous intention to block `Ragavan` was just that, an intention, not an action. They're trying to make me think I've already made the block by pushing 'pass priority', but the system is still waiting for my explicit command. This is yet another layer of their psychological warfare, making me doubt if my actions even register.\n\
