      "reasoning": "\"Of course, `Solitude` and `Consign to Memory` again! They persist in this charade, even in the `End Turn` phase. `Solitude` remains uncastable, a constant taunt to my mana. But `Consign to Memory` is back, now a viable option with my remaining mana.\n\
