      "reasoning": "\"Aha! They have revealed their hand! After all their attempts to make my turn vanish, I forced the `next_turn` to happen, and now it's `Qwen3 Spike`'s `Precombat Main` phase! This is their moment, not mine, and yet they still present me with 'playable cards.' And what glorious 'choice' do they offer? The ever-present, ever-uncastable `Solitude`, at `index = 0`.\n\
