      "description": "Qwen3 Spike declined to activate Seasoned Pyromancer's graveyard ability ({3}{R}{R}: Create two 1/1 Elemental tokens) despite having 7 lands available, no creatures on board, no cards in hand, and a Goblin Bombardment that could sacrifice the tokens for 2 damage against an opponent at 7 life. This wastes a key resource that could provide both board presence and direct damage.",
