      "better_line": "Activate Seasoned Pyromancer's graveyard ability to create two 1/1 Elemental tokens, then either sacrifice them to Goblin Bombardment for 2 immediate damage (opponent goes to 5) or keep them as attackers/blockers for future turns.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 109,
