      "decision_index": 132,
    },
    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "With an empty hand and empty board, Qwen3 Spike declined to activate Seasoned Pyromancer's graveyard ability ({3}{R}{R}: exile from graveyard to create two 1/1 Elemental tokens) despite having sufficient mana (7 lands including multiple red sources). The opponent is at 7 life with Goblin Bombardment on the battlefield, meaning these tokens could deal 2 damage via sacrifice and/or attack next turn. With zero other threats available, this was their only way to rebuild pressure.",
      "action_taken": "Passed without activating Seasoned Pyromancer from graveyard or cracking Flooded Strand",
      "better_line": "Activate Seasoned Pyromancer's graveyard ability to create two 1/1 Elemental tokens, then also crack Flooded Strand for mana fixing. The tokens provide immediate board presence and 2 points of Goblin Bombardment damage against an opponent at 7 life.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 110,
      "player": "Qwen3 Spike",
      "decision_index": 132,
    },
    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "At 4 life with 8 lands available, the player incorrectly believed Solitude ({3}{W}{W}) was uncastable. With Plains, Sacred Foundry, Meticulous Archive, Plains, Hallowed Fountain providing white mana and other lands for generic, Solitude was absolutely castable. A 3/2 lifelink creature would provide crucial life gain and board presence at 4 life against an opponent with Goblin Bombardment.",
      "action_taken": "Declined to cast anything, believing Solitude was uncastable and other options were invalid.",
